WEBVTT

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:37.520
Positively unspeakable to have had the secret of a hidden route from China to India right in our hands.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:43.120
There's no doubt, Sir Cedric, the Black Samurai abducted Mauling to prevent him from telling us that secret.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.260
The Black Samurai? That's obvious.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:55.670
It's equally obvious that their German leader, this... this Fraulein von Teufel, will find a way to force him to tell it to the Japs.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.160
- Is Ma Ling... - Yeah, Ma Ling's in there on his way to the Japanese sub.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.310
Get in there.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:11.940
Of course, it's not your fault, Hardy.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.380
No mine.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.510
But unless your police find the old boy and fetch him back,

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:20.340
I'll have to contact London and...

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:25.000
- Yes? - Police.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.120
Oh, right. Quite right.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.220
Keep me advised.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.300
An amazing chap, that Captain Martin.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.260
- And what is, what's happened?

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.880
- Seems he found where they were holding Mauling

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.920
and got himself caught doing it.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.500
- How'd he get word of the police?

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.840
- Managed to trick his captors

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.780
and phone his Australian friend, Thompson.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.460
The police are on their way now.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.850
- Don't come in there, put him on the tug

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.050
and lose him as soon as you can.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:21.310
Sit right here.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.040
Throw it over. It'll sink soon enough.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.700
Let's shove off.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:40.640
inside.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:46.710
Police.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:47.740
They.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.030
Records.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:04.350
- Take it easy, old man, you're a bit worse for wear.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:09.000
- I'll be all right, as soon as I get my breath back.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.810
Marling's in here, chloroformed.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.830
Get him out.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.510
Then don't leave him unguarded for one second

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.730
while he's in Hong Kong.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.040
Tommy Wing, you come with me.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:42.470
You've done more than saved Marling Jack. It looks as if these papers will put the

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:46.010
black samurai out of business in Hong Kong at any rate. And if this chap will talk

00:05:46.010 --> 00:06:00.000
maybe we'll put Fraulein von Teufel out of business as well. One thing's certain no one will

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:08.030
ever be able to make this man betray Fräulein von Teufel we owe you more than we can say uh Captain

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:14.080
Martin for your rescue of Marling thank you Sir Cedric Marling safety is my personal responsibility

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:19.000
semi-fascially of course I must say you're certainly doing a splendid job of it moreover

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:23.550
the evidence you uncovered resulted in the rounding up of the Hong Kong branch of the black samurai

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:30.000
including their leader Fräulein von Teufel fortunately no she and four of her agents escaped however the police have

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.340
Well, here's hoping they catch him.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.290
Marling's life is in constant danger

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.290
as long as Fraulein von Teufel is at large.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:07:00.000
This is for you, Fraulein von Teufel.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:15.080
I don't think I understand who are you I am Samson black samurai proceed what is the message

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:21.730
Kageyama says Marling must die it is dangerous to wait tell Kageyama I still make the decisions

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:30.000
for the black samurai as long as we have a chance to get the secret from Marling he must live but he might tell our enemies

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.050
- First.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.230
- He won't live that long.

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.190
I have been invited to the conference.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:39.190
I'll see to that.

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.850
If I ring for service during the day,

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.510
be sure you answer it yourself.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:04.490
Oh, it's you, Janet, come in.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:05.980
I'll order some more tea.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:06.980
You'd better not.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.580
If we're going to the conference, you'd better get dressed.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.020
It's almost time.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:18.270
All right, I won't be a minute.

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:21.850
An English translation of the pack, Sir Cedric.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.870
Uh, left my secretary.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:29.150
This will suffice for my purposes.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.000
This says...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:36.140
your excellency knows a secret route from China to India that is correct it

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:40.480
lies through the province of which I am governor and you are willing to grant

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:46.530
China the use of that route if China and Great Britain promised to close it again

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:52.420
after the war then wouldn't such a road bring valuable trade to your state after

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:58.900
the war nations with wealth or who want it are the ones at war

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:04.400
My country prefer their poverty and peace.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:09.350
I see China's already signed the pact.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:30.000
And since I am empowered to sign for Great Britain, learn the secret.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.530
requires one other signature.

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:33.780
Another signature?

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:34.480
Who's?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.870
That of the United States.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.910
The United States has no interest in the road.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.710
I think I can explain, Sir Cedric.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.110
His Excellency feels that a disinterested party

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:46.060
might prevent a later misinterpretation of the pact.

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:48.820
A conference has already been arranged at Honolulu.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.390
We are leaving by Clipper today.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.230
If His Excellency has reached a decision,

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.380
there is little else we can accomplish here.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.120
I'll have to hurry to make a reservation on the Clipper.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.220
I'll see you at the hotel.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.350
Any further word on those missing black Samurai agents?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.590
Only that we know positively there are four.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.160
One Jap and three Germans.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:29.280
Service.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:36.560
Send up a tea service for one, as quickly as possible.

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.000
One Jap and three Germans.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.610
I think your Excellency will be safer in here than in the lounge.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.150
But I suggest you keep this door locked.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:05.960
Thank you.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:16.520
Jack?

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:25.720
I must have been really out of danger.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.290
That's a wonderful feeling.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:43.300
- Good. Take over the ship tonight at quarter of ten.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:47.190
- That will only give us fifteen minutes before we landed at the rendezvous.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:14:00.000
- That's plenty of time. - You are disdelighted that I am taking care of us.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.330
- Did you see Fräulein von Teufel?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.050
- Yes, we are to take over by quarter to 10,

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.770
land at 10 for the rendezvous with our submarine.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.610
- So good, what now?

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.130
How about this ship and crew?

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.080
- This type paper makes our task easier.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.080
Let me show you.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.000
- Now in 10 minutes,

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.250
to take over that should be ample time everybody is certain of his assignment

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:42.580
very well it's now 9:35 p.m. by 9:45 we must be in control

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:14.860
Please.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.250
Drop that pistol for a bar and you two ladies, you're at the other end.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:30.690
- You too.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:34.500
Get over there with your friends.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.030
- Good going.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.190
The authorities spotted you in Hong Kong,

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.410
but I persuaded them to let you take the clipper

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.110
on the chance that you might give yourselves away

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.280
by trying to pull something.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.530
Thanks for walking into the trap.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.570
Now we ought to be able to talk, don't you think?

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.160
Sit down.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.510
I'm getting the clip's report clearly, sir.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:18.650
It is on course.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.860
But the code signal has not come over.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.130
I'm 50.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.830
You should have received confirmation of the capture by now.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.920
Thank you.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:35.080
spotted the cripples running right sir good man the guns if Fraulein von Teufel has failed we

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:39.710
have to shoot the clipper down but sir Fraulein von Teufel and Marling are very important nevertheless

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:51.550
they will have to take their chances those are Tokyo's owners yes sir so like Mr. and Mrs. Bauer

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:57.140
you still insist you don't know Fraulein von Teufel's identity so far I only have blank paper

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:03.130
- We've saved the best 'til the last.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:06.200
Do you know who Fraulein von Teufel is?

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.570
- I know nothing.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.450
- Somehow I believed the others were telling the truth

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:11.280
when they said they didn't know anything.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.560
- But you're lying.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.650
Now you people are spies, pirates.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.990
Piracy gets a death sentence in the United States.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:21.580
Now who's Fraulein von Teufel?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.410
Who is she?

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:29.700
- She's dead.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:38.000
It begins to look like Fraulein van Teufel isn't any farther away than one of the women in this compartment.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:48.320
Nobody leaves this room and we find out who killed that Jap.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:51.590
We'll have to search everybody for a weapon that could have fired that dart.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:18:00.000
Sorry, Trudy, but that Vince will kill you.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.010
It could have been rigged to fire a dart.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:14.060
Oh, certainly, Tommy.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:16.070
I am sorry, but it was the quickest way

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.690
of clearing you of suspicion.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:19.600
Nobody really suspected you, Trudy.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.480
Thanks, Jack.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.200
You had me worried for a moment.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.620
Now, please don't break this one.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.800
I need it for my work.
